    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of Adelu has always maintained peace and tranquility, and the forces of evil have been sealed for a long time. However, as the evil power awakens again, as a brave warrior, you are summoned again to engage in a desperate battle against the dark forces. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a third person RPG cartoon style game with female protagonists.There are a variety of skill designs: Assassination, Backstabbing, Bounce, Counter Attack, Pursuit, Combos, and Active Skills. By unlocking new skills and using a variety of active and passive skills, you will become even more powerful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/5ef607e1af7c8e3c98e8fa7073e7f57c.poster.avif?t=1752211169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/5ef607e1af7c8e3c98e8fa7073e7f57c.webm?t=1752211169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/5ef607e1af7c8e3c98e8fa7073e7f57c.mp4?t=1752211169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the plot progresses, different characters will join the team. Players can control newly added characters, and each character has their own talent and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/0872c7883940670ea648b27d2ad90ea0.poster.avif?t=1752211169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/0872c7883940670ea648b27d2ad90ea0.webm?t=1752211169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/0872c7883940670ea648b27d2ad90ea0.mp4?t=1752211169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of enemies in the game: melee types, long-range attack types, magic types and giant creatures, different monsters have different attack characteristics, and mastering the enemy's attack characteristics is the key to your successful defeat of the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has rich scenes: mountains, forests, castles, dungeons, caves, snow, etc. The game belongs to the cartoon type and is created using a Unreal Engine 5, featuring \u201cZelda\u201c style scenes! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of Adelu has always maintained peace and tranquility, and the forces of evil have been sealed for a long time. However, as the evil power awakens again, as a brave warrior, you are summoned again to engage in a desperate battle against the dark forces. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a third person RPG cartoon style game with female protagonists.There are a variety of skill designs: Assassination, Backstabbing, Bounce, Counter Attack, Pursuit, Combos, and Active Skills. By unlocking new skills and using a variety of active and passive skills, you will become even more powerful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/5ef607e1af7c8e3c98e8fa7073e7f57c.poster.avif?t=1752211169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/5ef607e1af7c8e3c98e8fa7073e7f57c.webm?t=1752211169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/5ef607e1af7c8e3c98e8fa7073e7f57c.mp4?t=1752211169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the plot progresses, different characters will join the team. Players can control newly added characters, and each character has their own talent and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/0872c7883940670ea648b27d2ad90ea0.poster.avif?t=1752211169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/0872c7883940670ea648b27d2ad90ea0.webm?t=1752211169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099680/extras/0872c7883940670ea648b27d2ad90ea0.mp4?t=1752211169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of enemies in the game: melee types, long-range attack types, magic types and giant creatures, different monsters have different attack characteristics, and mastering the enemy's attack characteristics is the key to your successful defeat of the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has rich scenes: mountains, forests, castles, dungeons, caves, snow, etc. The game belongs to the cartoon type and is created using a Unreal Engine 5, featuring \u201cZelda\u201c style scenes! </p>",
    "short_description": "This game is a third person RPG cartoon game with Zelda style scene design. In the process of fighting against dark forces, you will constantly become stronger, unlock new abilities, and flexibly use multiple skills to defeat enemies in bloody battles.",
